WEBVTT

00:04.740 --> 00:07.230
Oh, good. Bahamut, are you okay?

00:10.880 --> 00:12.480
What is this? What's going on?

00:56.610 --> 00:58.550
The demiurge punished the people...

00:59.420 --> 01:01.830
...by spreading misfortune
throughout the land.

01:02.920 --> 01:05.010
Realizing this, the
people of the dragon...

01:06.150 --> 01:08.630
...sent scouts to ascertain the situation.

02:36.940 --> 02:40.050
I'll Go Deep!

02:47.700 --> 02:51.310
You know, I wish you'd listen to me.

02:52.740 --> 02:53.810
Huh?

02:54.620 --> 02:56.840
This little fairy...

02:57.260 --> 02:59.090
Oh, that's me.

02:59.840 --> 03:04.740
...seems to be able to read my thoughts,
so I'm gonna have her translate.

03:05.050 --> 03:07.660
Are you sure you're translating that right?

03:08.040 --> 03:09.280
Of course.

03:11.720 --> 03:14.750
I don't get the feeling you are.

03:21.530 --> 03:23.520
My name is Yurlungur.

03:24.400 --> 03:28.560
I accidentally swallowed something
that sank into the swamp.

03:29.290 --> 03:33.750
I believe that may be why I haven't
been feeling well recently.

03:34.170 --> 03:34.980
Huh?

03:35.850 --> 03:37.600
Grab onto this!

03:45.600 --> 03:48.330
Are you saying you swallowed that?

03:49.060 --> 03:52.150
I thought it might be your doing.

03:53.060 --> 03:57.210
In that case, I would like for you
to enter my body and retrieve it.

03:57.470 --> 03:58.500
What?

03:58.800 --> 04:02.030
Yes. And one more thing...

04:02.980 --> 04:04.510
You two.

04:07.580 --> 04:11.230
I wish you would put on some clothes...

04:17.790 --> 04:20.400
Hey, what are we going to do?

04:20.400 --> 04:23.410
What do you mean?
We'll all have to go together.

04:23.410 --> 04:26.490
It's your axe. You should go.

04:26.490 --> 04:29.260
This only happened because
I was trying to save you.

04:29.260 --> 04:30.580
If anyone's going, you are.

04:30.580 --> 04:32.490
I refuse!

04:32.490 --> 04:36.380
Entering his mouth is like going to be eaten!

04:36.730 --> 04:38.810
What are we going to do about the axe, then?

04:38.810 --> 04:40.320
Like I said, you...

04:40.320 --> 04:41.750
Why only me?

04:41.750 --> 04:43.230
It's your axe!

04:44.240 --> 04:46.660
But I was trying to save you!

04:47.190 --> 04:48.050
What?

04:53.560 --> 04:54.790
I will go.

05:00.380 --> 05:02.070
Now, this is interesting...

05:03.120 --> 05:04.700
Open your mouth.

05:12.060 --> 05:14.170
Hey, wait. I'll go with you.

05:19.260 --> 05:21.720
Oh, fine! I'll go with you!

05:21.720 --> 05:23.790
Just don't leave me alone!

05:28.780 --> 05:30.790
Yurlungur is saying something.

05:31.220 --> 05:32.890
Oh? What did he say?

05:34.450 --> 05:37.130
You taste pretty good.

05:39.880 --> 05:42.270
Sorry, sorry. I was just kidding.

05:42.700 --> 05:43.600
Hey!

05:44.990 --> 05:46.700
Oh, come on!

05:46.700 --> 05:49.130
Now, now. No need to be so angry.

05:49.130 --> 05:50.520
Who wouldn't be angry?

05:50.520 --> 05:53.010
Don't you realize the
situation we're in?

05:54.880 --> 05:56.200
What is this?

05:56.710 --> 05:58.900
Wow, it's a huge uvula.

05:59.450 --> 06:01.340
Huh? An uvu...

06:02.190 --> 06:05.210
It's... huge.

06:10.810 --> 06:12.530
It's a crossroads.

06:12.530 --> 06:14.320
Which way should we go?

06:14.320 --> 06:16.190
Let's try the bottom one first.

06:19.830 --> 06:22.040
It's slippery, so be careful.

06:25.410 --> 06:27.020
Be careful.

06:27.020 --> 06:28.280
I know.

06:42.780 --> 06:44.670
Is everyone okay?

06:44.670 --> 06:48.170
How did that happen right after
we told you to be careful?!

06:49.240 --> 06:50.380
I'm sorry...

06:50.380 --> 06:52.510
I don't care if you're just
pretending to be sorry!

06:54.440 --> 06:55.550
What is this?

06:56.630 --> 06:58.730
They're rising and falling...

06:58.730 --> 07:00.130
Could they be his lungs?

07:01.460 --> 07:02.650
Yurlungur...

07:03.050 --> 07:04.200
Is he saying something?

07:04.960 --> 07:06.360
He said they're his lungs.

07:09.960 --> 07:12.700
Well, that was a waste of time.

07:12.700 --> 07:15.030
Whatever you do, don't look up.

07:16.100 --> 07:18.290
What cute scales.

07:22.880 --> 07:24.940
We're finally back.

07:24.940 --> 07:26.290
We'll go this way next.

07:28.060 --> 07:30.510
Another one of these paths?

07:31.930 --> 07:34.220
Don't slip this time.

07:34.500 --> 07:35.440
I know.

07:35.920 --> 07:36.950
I'll do my best.

07:39.560 --> 07:41.560
Again?!

07:46.040 --> 07:47.790
Is everyone alive?

07:47.790 --> 07:50.110
Yes, somehow...

07:50.290 --> 07:52.110
Leviatan!

07:53.000 --> 07:53.920
I'm sorry...

07:54.310 --> 07:56.450
I thought I told you to cut that out!

07:58.620 --> 08:00.200
I'm sick of this!

08:00.200 --> 08:03.790
I'm tired, I'm hungry,
and I can't move any more!

08:04.320 --> 08:06.960
I'm hungry, too.

08:06.960 --> 08:08.070
Me, too.

08:08.070 --> 08:10.200
Oh, me! I'm hungry, too!

08:10.630 --> 08:12.800
This part might be
good if we cooked it.

08:14.650 --> 08:16.670
No, that's disgusting.

08:16.670 --> 08:18.990
I could never eat that.

08:18.990 --> 08:20.970
What? You mean you don't know?

08:20.970 --> 08:22.960
Roasted giblets are delicious.

08:22.960 --> 08:25.560
Get your grill good and
hot with a charcoal fire,

08:25.560 --> 08:27.900
and put some fresh giblets on top.

08:27.900 --> 08:30.510
Fat drips from them as they start to cook,

08:30.510 --> 08:33.030
filling the air with a pleasant aroma...

08:33.630 --> 08:36.080
Th-That doesn't sound so bad.

08:36.080 --> 08:37.200
It sounds delicious.

08:42.150 --> 08:44.220
A little bit can't hurt, right?

08:44.220 --> 08:46.080
I can make fire, too.

08:46.720 --> 08:47.640
It's decided, then.

08:48.170 --> 08:48.960
Ouch!

08:51.250 --> 08:52.520
Where did that fruit come from?

08:54.340 --> 09:00.520
Maybe Yurlungur swallowed it for
us so we wouldn't eat his giblets.

09:00.520 --> 09:02.700
In that case, let's help ourselves...

09:05.160 --> 09:10.880
Basically, anything that giant eats
comes falling into his stomach here.

09:10.880 --> 09:13.490
I wish he had swallowed
something better.

09:13.750 --> 09:15.240
Something better?

09:15.390 --> 09:16.490
Beef bowls!

09:16.490 --> 09:17.280
Pudding!

09:17.630 --> 09:18.740
Barley tea...

09:32.730 --> 09:36.030
Oh? It's rather noisy outside.

09:51.000 --> 09:52.440
He's going to eat us!

09:54.060 --> 09:56.430
I-I don't taste very good.

09:56.430 --> 09:58.690
She's much softer and delicious.

09:58.690 --> 10:02.200
No, no. She's wearing slimming
clothes, but she's actually...

10:04.900 --> 10:05.810
Huh?

10:07.320 --> 10:09.550
W-Would you like some chopsticks?

10:21.880 --> 10:23.810
It's delicious!

10:24.280 --> 10:25.690
That looks good.

10:25.690 --> 10:26.820
You're right.

10:27.550 --> 10:29.500
Pudding!

10:29.500 --> 10:31.310
My pudding!

10:34.140 --> 10:35.460
Barley tea...

10:36.430 --> 10:38.970
My barley tea...

10:39.490 --> 10:43.790
Hey! If you're going to swallow barley
tea, swallow a container, too!

10:43.790 --> 10:45.810
Why did you drink it by itself?!

10:48.510 --> 10:50.220
My barley tea.

10:53.380 --> 10:55.340
Thanks for the food.

10:55.340 --> 10:57.320
Shall we get going?

10:57.320 --> 10:59.540
Wait. I'm going to eat this.

10:59.960 --> 11:01.640
Are you taking that with you?

11:01.640 --> 11:04.670
Yes. I love barley tea.

11:08.010 --> 11:10.160
We still haven't found that axe.

11:10.160 --> 11:12.770
Maybe it went even deeper.

11:13.260 --> 11:15.830
This is like the place we just were.

11:16.700 --> 11:18.360
This is his second stomach.

11:18.770 --> 11:21.630
Apparently, Yurlungur has four stomachs.

11:23.010 --> 11:26.330
That's great, but what's this slimy stuff?

11:26.330 --> 11:28.500
Oh, those are his gastric juices.

11:28.500 --> 11:29.480
What?!

11:29.480 --> 11:31.790
Are we going to be melted?

11:31.790 --> 11:33.760
Our scales are going to melt.

11:33.760 --> 11:34.630
What?!

11:38.550 --> 11:42.010
It's okay. You won't melt that quickly.

11:42.010 --> 11:43.350
Oh, I see.

11:43.350 --> 11:45.220
Don't scare us like that.

11:45.220 --> 11:46.250
Probably, anyway.

12:03.950 --> 12:07.140
The axe wasn't in his third stomach either.

12:07.140 --> 12:09.790
Maybe it already came out the other end.

12:09.790 --> 12:11.960
What? Don't say gross stuff like that.

12:12.600 --> 12:15.180
Could that be his fourth stomach?

12:24.560 --> 12:25.430
Look!

12:26.350 --> 12:28.060
I've seen those before.

12:29.270 --> 12:30.360
Those are...

12:31.640 --> 12:33.740
I know! Does he have worms?

12:33.740 --> 12:35.660
No, they're Toripu!

12:36.680 --> 12:38.160
What are Toripu doing in here?

12:38.710 --> 12:41.650
They must be leeching nutrients from him.

12:41.650 --> 12:42.990
They're doing what?

12:42.990 --> 12:44.660
Could it be...?

12:45.300 --> 12:47.190
My name is Yurlungur.

12:47.710 --> 12:51.160
I accidentally swallowed something
that sank into the swamp.

12:51.650 --> 12:56.120
I believe that may be why I haven't
been feeling well recently.

12:57.290 --> 12:59.850
He feels sick...

12:59.850 --> 13:01.880
...because of these!

13:01.880 --> 13:05.580
Stealing someone's food from inside
their stomach is unforgivable!

13:06.080 --> 13:09.350
Well, we did do something similar.

13:09.350 --> 13:11.940
I'll chop them to bits!

13:11.940 --> 13:13.850
Chop them? How?

13:13.850 --> 13:15.560
It's obvious!

13:15.560 --> 13:17.110
With my axe...

13:17.510 --> 13:18.870
My axe!

13:19.950 --> 13:22.520
Did you forget we came
here to find that axe?

13:30.780 --> 13:31.690
Huh?

13:33.190 --> 13:34.250
Bahamut!

13:35.010 --> 13:38.920
These things never give up!

13:41.110 --> 13:42.220
Thanks!

13:42.220 --> 13:44.320
Come on, aim better.

13:44.320 --> 13:45.530
I'm doing the best I can.

13:45.530 --> 13:46.880
I'm just missing a little.

13:50.310 --> 13:51.320
What's going on?

13:51.320 --> 13:53.230
My stomach hurts...

13:54.230 --> 13:57.100
Stop! You're hurting Yurlungur.

13:57.100 --> 13:58.940
What am I supposed to do, then?

14:00.730 --> 14:01.920
I'll do it.

14:01.920 --> 14:05.160
What can a water user like you
do without any water?

14:05.560 --> 14:06.570
I have this.

14:06.570 --> 14:08.550
That's not nearly enough.

15:22.930 --> 15:25.070
I knew you could do it.

15:34.350 --> 15:35.410
You did it!

15:38.630 --> 15:39.730
What's that?

15:39.730 --> 15:40.500
What?

15:49.340 --> 15:51.880
What's going on? There's a huge one.

15:52.240 --> 15:53.090
There!

15:55.740 --> 15:57.260
It's no use! It's not working!

16:01.900 --> 16:03.520
It's coming this way!

16:03.520 --> 16:06.050
Barley tea, gather!

16:15.210 --> 16:16.240
Leviatan.

16:17.300 --> 16:21.540
My barley tea!

16:34.860 --> 16:36.220
My axe.

16:36.220 --> 16:38.370
He had swallowed it.

16:38.370 --> 16:39.770
Are you okay?

16:39.770 --> 16:42.710
Transforming consumes physical
and spiritual strength.

16:43.850 --> 16:45.970
I think I may have pushed myself too hard...

16:46.520 --> 16:49.600
But I'm glad we were able
to defeat all of them.

16:57.400 --> 16:59.450
It's slimy.

17:04.890 --> 17:06.230
Filthy!

17:06.230 --> 17:07.320
You're so mean!

17:14.320 --> 17:15.920
I'm exhausted.

17:15.920 --> 17:19.810
I'm never going into anyone's stomach again.

17:20.240 --> 17:23.260
Those who have returned
from inside my body...

17:24.750 --> 17:28.610
Thanks to you, I am feeling better.

17:29.330 --> 17:34.530
To show my gratitude, call on
me whenever you are in trouble.

17:35.850 --> 17:38.620
I promise to come to your aid.

17:39.230 --> 17:42.540
A-Also, Leviatan...

17:44.090 --> 17:51.880
You can call me even if you're not in trouble.

18:16.590 --> 18:19.040
Who are you calling filthy?!

18:23.480 --> 18:28.210
You were amazing when you
defeated the Toripu.

18:28.710 --> 18:33.250
Getting to see that made it worth
entering Yurlungur's stomach.

18:33.740 --> 18:38.010
By the way, why did you volunteer to go...

18:38.010 --> 18:40.210
...when he asked us to retrieve the axe?

18:43.270 --> 18:48.370
That only happened because I'm
still inexperienced with magic.

20:12.870 --> 25:00.000
Next Episode

20:15.750 --> 25:00.000
I'll Call You!
